{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/diva-reportage-properties-yas-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":438,"crm_id":"221","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Diva","slug":"diva-reportage-properties-yas-island","display_address":"Yas Island","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Reportage Properties","price":930000,"display_price":"930K","lattitude":24.4631479,"longitude":54.5956639,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"DIVA Residential Complex is located on Yas Island, one of the most popular destinations in Abu Dhabi. The project combines everything that the island itself is so famous for: luxury, entertainment, recreation areas and proximity to the sea. South of Yas, a stone's throw from Yas Bay Waterfront, are the Diva Towers, two luxury residential buildings with a unique contemporary design. They are located in a lively but quiet area with developed infrastructure. Here you will find 19 parks, 2 schools, 3 mosques and many shops. Settling in Diva, you will discover all the delights of island life and get a personal resort with access to the main roads of the city. AMAZING OPPORTUNITIES Yas South is the perfect place to live and invest. There is a multifunctional area Yas Bay, which claims to be the main coastal space in Abu Dhabi. It includes three separate blocks: Yas Bay Waterfront, Yas Bay Residences and Media Zone. Yas Bay Waterfront is an entertainment district that houses the Hilton hotel, cafes, restaurants, shops, a cinema, a beach club and the famous Etihad Arena. Not far from it you can find a modern residential complex Yas Bay Residences, where there is everything for a comfortable life on Yas Island: 19 parks, 2 schools, 3 mosques, many shops within walking distance.","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_imag